ndex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted"></span></div><div class=""></div></div></div></div><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--medium" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><div class="DetailsLayoutRightParagraph"><div class="DetailsLayoutRightParagraph__widthConstrained"><span class="Formatted">USA TODAY BESTSELLING AUTHOR<br /><br />Never miss a release! Follow Liz here &amp; sign up for her newsletter: <br /><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="https://bit.ly/LIZ-NEWSLETTER">https://bit.ly/LIZ-NEWSLETTER</a><br /><br />FREE Series Reading Order: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="https://lizabethscottbooks.com/reading-list">https://lizabethscottbooks.com/readin...</a><br /><br />FREE entry into Lizabeth Scott Readers Group on Facebook: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/LizabethScottReaderGroup">https://www.facebook.com/groups/Lizab...</a><br /><br />Lizabeth Scott is a USA Today Bestselling Author known for delivering sizzling, emotionally charged romance that keeps readers up all night. With a signature blend of heart, heat, and humor, she creates unforgettable characters who fight hard, love harder, and always leave readers begging for more.<br /><br />Whether she's writing billionaires with a soft spot, motorcycle club alphas with a code of honor, or royal heirs tangled in scandal and seduction, Lizabeth brings her stories to life with passion, grit, and the perfect touch of vulnerability. Her books span contemporary, spicy, and romantic suspense subgenres—each filled with slow-burn tension, steamy chemistry, and happily-ever-afters that feel deeply earned.<br /><br />When she’s not writing, Lizabeth loves connecting with readers, plotting her next twisty romance, or creating custom swag and bonus content to surprise her loyal fans. With dozens of bestselling titles to her name, including the fan-favorite Royal Heirs and Kings of Chaos series, she’s built a romance empire that continues to grow—one love story at a time.<br /><br />Lizabeth believes in strong heroines, complicated heroes, and the kind of love that changes everything.<br /><br />Stay connected and follow the passion:<br />📚 <a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow" href="http://www.lizscottbooks.com">www.lizscottbooks.com</a><br /><br />📸 @lizabethscottromance on Instagram &amp; Facebook<br /><br />💌 Sign up for her VIP reader newsletter for exclusive content, giveaways, and early access to new releases.<br /><br /><br /><br /></span></div></div></div><div class=""></div></div><hr class="Divider Divider--largeMargin" role="presentation"/></div></div></div><div class="BookPage__relatedTopContent"><div class="lazyload-wrapper "><div style="height:500px" class="lazyload-placeholder"></div></div></div><div class="BookPage__reviewsSection"><div id="ReviewsSection" class="ReviewsSection"><div class="ReviewsSection__header"><h2 class="Text Text__title2">Ratings <span class="Text Text__italic">&amp;</span> Reviews</h2></div><article class="WriteReviewCTA"><div class="Avatar Avatar--medium Avatar--placeholder" tabindex="0"><span data-testid="other" class="Avatar__image"><i class="Icon UserIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 150 148" data-testid="placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Profile Image for undefined."><path d="M72.1090777,98.5834547 L72.33,99 L72.33,135.33 C63.123,121.832538 36.682493,123.584992 32.5469267,123.94781 L32,124 L26.33,84 C60.339272,80.657364 70.5568596,95.8470233 72.1090777,98.5834547 L72.1090777,98.5834547 Z M124.67,84 L119,124 L118.443602,123.94698 C114.277312,123.582336 87.87,121.8428 78.67,135.33 L78.67,99 L78.7678523,98.8072222 C79.812448,96.840024 89.5704,80.5502 124.67,84 Z M78,99.33 L78,135.33 L73,135.33 L73,99.33 L78,99.33 Z M90.54,16.62 C95.9310499,21.4073864 96.3803576,28.3598605 96.2905081,29.8922458 C97.3275946,32.4456044 97.9829705,35.2277293 98.1784348,38.1513546 C100.50