ll"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/6654946813">July 17, 2024</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Simple and quick. I was hoping for a bit more meat with this book. <br />Very fast burn, basically Insta-love, which is not my favorite. Also quite a bit melodramatic, all the feelings were big feelings. Lots of wild mood shifts, jumping into arms, declaring love and the like. It had the bones of a good, emotional story but didn't have the meat. Things move along very quickly, difficult decisions are made within hours. <br />I enjoyed the FMC being completely deaf. She could read voices like a pro, which makes me wonder how long she's been deaf to have such perfect speech. <br />All in all, not bad, but nothing deep or satisfying. </span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22948816?shelf=disability-rep" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">disability-rep</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22948816?shelf=low-stakes" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">low-stakes</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/22948816?shelf=richie-rich-hero" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">richie-rich-hero</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline 