ki sends his son Creston over. From the instant he sees her he knows she’s different. Creston is known for the playboy, any girl he wants he gets by smiling. When they finally meet her at her work, she’s completely ignores him which he isn’t use to. They both are attracted to each other but don’t admit to it. This relationship is beautiful as it progressively grows. When Elisha is told the truth of her father, what she thought and was told have been lies. Elisha doubts the love of her father because of impairment which Creston reassures her how much her father has loved her. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThe love between them finally get too much both having doubt they are good enough for one another but they are so perfect. Creston never knew he would ever fall in love and after being hurt so much Elisha felt the same. You go on an adventures with them. Elisha doubts that her father will love her because there are things he doesn’t know about her. Creston is always by her side supporting her, showing her how life will be. I enjoyed reading sweet prince falls in love with a princess at first time. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI did not at one stage want to put this book down. This is the first book of Lizabeths I have read and it won’t my last. ","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AUS2O3MXXWW90\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:46936188":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":46936188,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1553836139i/46936188._UX200_CR0,1,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":23,"textReviewsCount":726,"name":"Bookiechick  Reviews","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/46936188-bookiechick-reviews","contributor":null,"id":46936188},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/46936188?shelf=read"},"taggings":[],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/3456930227"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rnfva08IUdDedfPtKkaoBQ":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.rnfva08IUdDedfPtKkaoBQ","creator":{"__ref":"User:46936188"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1676296255731,"createdAt":1595752109542,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1595752123395,"text":"Lizabeth Scott is a new to me author and I can say she has a new fan! I’ll definitely be checking out more of her work. \u003cbr /\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eI didn’t know what to expect with this book. I’m not usually one to read blurbs so I went in blind and I can safely say I was pleasantly surprised. I usually go for the dark angsty but this was a nice change. I’m glad I gave it a go cause it’s a story that I won’t be forgetting anytime soon.\u003cbr /\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eAmazing characters, creative and detailed world building. I enjoyed how each character was unique and who you thought was the star actually wasn’t. Lis really stood out for me. Her character presence was really pronounced even in the subtlest ways. She definitely both complimented as well as contrast nicely with Cres. Their story felt surreal but you couldn’t help but be drawn in, like a modern day fairytale.\u003cbr /\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eDefinitely a ride emotionally, not as hard hitting as what I’m accustomed too but I enjoyed this nonetheless. Definitely a well paced book. It didn’t leave you without some trying moments as well as feel good moments, it had the perfect balance of all and I’m left feeling like I experienced the best wave at the beach, excited, exhilarated and satisfied. \u003cbr /\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003eI’m definitely looking forward to what Lizabeth has in store for us next! ","rating":4,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3O6V2VXM2NXLS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys\"}}"},"likeCount":1,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:25556913":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":25556913,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1424595464i/25556913._UY200_CR47,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":175,"textReviewsCount":9584,"name":"Isha Coleman","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/25556913-isha-coleman","contributor":null,"id":25556913},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1768OHPC9M5KC":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1768OHPC9M5KC"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1768OHPC9M5KC\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1768OHPC9M5KC","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1768OHPC9M5KC"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.SgOnQg6upNjsa1Ys"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/25556913?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"first-reads","webUrl":"https://www.g